    "public_preview": null,
    "text": "we spend so much of our lives trying to fit into something that was never meant for us.⁠\n⁠\ntrying to be smaller.⁠\nquieter.⁠\nmore acceptable.⁠\n⁠\nbut somewhere in that effort,⁠\nwe lose pieces of ourselves we don’t get back.⁠\n⁠\nthis is a reminder to choose differently.⁠\n⁠\nThe Best of Atticus Poetry is a collection for the ones unlearning that life has to look a certain way—⁠\nand remembering it was always meant to be lived fully.",
